<!-- Pain points -->
<section class="bg-canvas py-20 px-6 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-serif font-normal text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.15] mb-4 text-ink max-w-xl">Easy to put off, expensive to ignore.</h2>
    <p class="text-dim text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed opacity-70 max-w-xl mb-12">A lot changes when you start a family, and most of the paperwork quietly falls behind. None of it is urgent, until it suddenly is.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "heart", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">Old nominees, new family</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Insurance and bank nominees often still point to parents, or no one, long after a wedding.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "users", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">Two people, two systems</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Before, everyone had their own way of tracking things. After, often nobody does.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "file-plus", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">A baby comes with paperwork</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Birth certificate, health insurance, school admissions later: a whole new category of documents arrives fast.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "clock", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">No will, "for now"</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Most couples plan to write a will eventually. Eventually rarely arrives on its own.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

